Z||000005||PatrickB||06-13-2001||11:07 PM||||Company you saw in Daytona Beach was probably Florida Auto Trim.  They are located in Holly Hill which is right by Daytona.  They sell both synthetic and real carbon fiber in all different colors for a lot of cars including the fiero.  <P>I have an account opened up with them.  I might be able to get one for cheap if interested.||||reg||1
