Z||000014||FieroLisa||06-14-2001||04:01 PM||||Well <A HREF="http://www.autodash.com" TARGET=_blank>www.autodash.com</A>  seems to be excellent! They have several different manufacturers on their site. I emailed in a question about having some samples sent in to me and just a few hours later, I get a call back from them explaining whats in each kit, and the lady talked with me about the color of my car and is sending me 3 or 4 color samples. I'm definitely ordering from them!||||reg||1
